    {
      "source": "If the current test method of the supplied <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">test\ncontext</a> is annotated with <code>@DirtiesContext</code> and the <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#methodMode()\">method mode</a> is set to <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.MethodMode.html#AFTER_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_METHOD</code></a>, or if the test class is\nannotated with <code>@DirtiesContext</code> and the <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">class mode</a> is set to <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD</code></a>, the\n<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">application context</a> of the test context\nwill be <a href=\"../TestContext.html#markApplicationContextDirty(org.springframework.test.annotation.DirtiesContext.HierarchyMode)\">marked as dirty</a> and the\n<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> in the test context will be set to <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "如果提供的 <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">测试上下文</a> 的当前测试方法已使用 <code>@DirtiesContext</code> 注解，且 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#methodMode()\">方法模式</a> 设置为 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.MethodMode.html#AFTER_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_METHOD</code></a>；或者测试类已使用 <code>@DirtiesContext</code> 注解，且 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">类模式</a> 设置为 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD</code></a>，则测试上下文的 <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">应用上下文</a> 将被 <a href=\"../TestContext.html#markApplicationContextDirty(org.springframework.test.annotation.DirtiesContext.HierarchyMode)\">标记为脏</a>，并且测试上下文中的 <a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> 将被设置为 <code>true</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the test class of the supplied <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">test context</a>\nis annotated with <code>@DirtiesContext</code> and the <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">class mode</a> is set to <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_CLASS</code></a>, the <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">application context</a> of the test context will be\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html#markApplicationContextDirty(org.springframework.test.annotation.DirtiesContext.HierarchyMode)\">marked as dirty</a>, and the\n<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> in the test context will be set to\n<code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "如果提供的 <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">测试上下文</a> 的测试类已使用 <code>@DirtiesContext</code> 注解，并且 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">类模式</a> 设置为 <a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_CLASS</code></a>，则测试上下文的 <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">应用上下文</a> 将被\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html#markApplicationContextDirty(org.springframework.test.annotation.DirtiesContext.HierarchyMode)\">标记为脏</a>，并且测试上下文中的\n<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> 将被设置为\n<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"#ORDER\">3000</a>, which ensures that the <code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code>\nis ordered after the\n<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>\nand before the <a href=\"CommonCachesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>CommonCachesTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回<a href=\"#ORDER\">3000</a>，这确保了<code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code>在<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>之后且在<code>CommonCachesTestExecutionListener</code>之前执行。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a> value for this listener: 3000.",
      "translation": "此监听器的<a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a>值为：3000。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This listener supports test methods with the\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#methodMode()\">method mode</a> set to\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.MethodMode.html#AFTER_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_METHOD</code></a> and test classes with the\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">class mode</a> set to\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD</code></a> or\n<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_CLASS</code></a>. For support for <em>BEFORE</em>\nmodes, see <a href=\"DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "该监听器支持将<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#methodMode()\">方法模式</a>设置为<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.MethodMode.html#AFTER_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_METHOD</code></a>的测试方法，以及将<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.html#classMode()\">类模式</a>设置为<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD\"><code>AFTER_EACH_TEST_METHOD</code></a>或<a href=\"../../annotation/DirtiesContext.ClassMode.html#AFTER_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_CLASS</code></a>的测试类。有关对<em>BEFORE</em>模式的支持，请参阅 <a href=\"DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When <a href=\"../TestExecutionListeners.html#mergeMode()\">merging</a>\n<code>TestExecutionListeners</code> with the defaults, this listener will\nautomatically be ordered after the <a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>;\notherwise, this listener must be manually configured to execute after the\n<code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code>.",
      "translation": "当与默认值<a href=\"../TestExecutionListeners.html#mergeMode()\">合并</a><code>TestExecutionListeners</code>时，此监听器将自动安排在<a href=\"DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>之后执行；否则，必须手动配置此监听器以在<code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code>之后执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
